RANDOM STATEMENT - CORTEX BASIC REV. 1.1

              2         IDT  'RANDOM'
              3  *
              4  *
              5  *
              6         REF  NLIN              ;EXIT TO MULTIPLEXOR
              7         DXOP EVFIX,11          ;EVALUATE AND FIX
              8         REF  RANDS             ;RANDOM NUMBER SEED
              9  *
             10         DEF  RANY
             11  * ABSTRACT:
             12  *
             13  *       THE RANDOM COMMAND WILL SET THE RANDOM
             14  *       SEED.
             15  *
             16  * CALLING SEQUENCE:
             17  *
             18  *       B @RANY
             19  *
             20  *       EXIT TO NLIN
             21  *
             22  * EXCEPTIONS AND CONDITIONS:  (NONE)
             23  *
             24  *
0000 2EE0    25  RANY   EVFIX @RANDS           ;GET RANDOM SEED
0002 0000 
0004 0460    26         B    @NLIN
0006 0000 
             27         END
